{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Strange Coincidences", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Mind Over Matter", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 6, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe complicated or unusual events in the past through a wider range of B1 language in both work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level. ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Be supposed to", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the structure <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the past, present or future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The structure is:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "subject + to be + supposed to + verb", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">am supposed to decide</span> on my travel plans by next week. <br/>The doctor says I<span class=\"strong\">'m supposed to lose</span> 20 pounds.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "**Pronunciation tip**:<br/>When you say be supposed to, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Like this:<br/>Be suppose_to", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You are supposed to drink a concoction of lemon juice, honey, and cayenne pepper.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You are not supposed to drink or eat anything else.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I was supposed to lose more!", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I am supposed to revisit my blog about healthy eating.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the Present Perfect tense to talk about experience.<br/>When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To emphasize the result of the action, use the simple form.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\"><ul><li>Have you been on a diet before? Yes, I have.<br/><br/></li><li>Have you been on a diet like the doctor asked you? No, I haven't.</li></ul></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Have you ever lost that much weight before that quickly?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Have you ever been on a diet?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Have you done any research on them?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Have you ever been on a cleanse?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "No, I haven't.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "insane", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that is irrational", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: ... you are not supposed to drink or eat anything else. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What? That's insane! Only that?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about extreme weight loss.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "trend", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a general direction in which a situation is changing or developing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This time I'm going to talk about diet trends.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "annual", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happening or returning each year", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was going on the annual family trip to Mexico. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "cleanse", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the action of cleaning your organism of toxins", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  Cool. What about cleanses? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "all the rage", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in current fashion; being a current fad", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I went on the Lemon Cleanse. It's all the rage. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "concoction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a strange or unusual mixture of things, especially drinks or medicines", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Oh. It's all the rage. You are supposed to drink a concoction of lemon juice, honey, and cayenne pepper. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "revisit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to visit again", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I am supposed to revisit my blog about healthy eating.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le16ob06aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Research one recent diet trend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Make a 5 minute presentation explaining the diet, its good points and bad points and finally, would you recommend this diet.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After, students vote on the most sensible sounding diet and the most insane sounding diet.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research a diet trend.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I 